摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Inspired By Calude design, A Deepseek harness Design Plugin!, Select elements, Use Open Router Vision agents, upload images and much more!! You can make quick changes with deepseek or invoke the Vision model with a prompt directly!","id":"gh:1334620863","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DSH-Design-Studio","slug":"Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Inspired By Calude design, A Deepseek harness Design Plugin!, Select elements, Use Open Router Visio"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"n agents, upload images and much more!! You can make quick changes with deepseek or invoke the Visio"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"n model with a prompt directly!"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @sal7one/dsh-design-studio"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A **DeepSeek Harness plugin** that turns design mockups into a first-class AI workflow.\nLive preview"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"s, an element picker, a real design agent, vision review, identity presets —\nand a two-agent apply f"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"low where **DeepSeek edits and the design agent verifies**.\nEverything is backed by real files in th"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"e current workspace under\n`design-studio/`, and the install is **launch-persistent**: install once, "},{"id":"p3s5","text":"the\nDesign Studio tab is there on every launch."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Preview | Selection | Ask DeepSeek | Assets |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| [](https://raw.g"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ithubusercontent.com/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-preview.png) | [](https://r"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"aw.githubusercontent.com/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-select.png) | [](https:"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"//raw.githubusercontent.com/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-edit-request.png) | "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"[](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-assets.png)"},{"id":"p5s6","text":" |\n| **Styles** | **Style tour** | **History** | **Settings** |\n| [](https://raw.githubusercontent.c"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"om/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-style-atlas.png) | [](https://raw.githubuserc"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"ontent.com/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-style-tour.png) | [](https://raw.gith"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"ubusercontent.com/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-history.png) | [](https://raw."},{"id":"p5s10","text":"githubusercontent.com/Sal7one/DSH-Design-Studio/master/repo-images/studio-settings.png) |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"*Click any screenshot for the full-size image.*"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Core platform"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **One command, persistent** — a dual-face `dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client` package:\n`dsh plugin add` on"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ce, and the tool, the preview route, the prompt section and the\n**Design Studio tab** are present on"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" every launch. No install-time build step, no\nTypeScript, **zero runtime dependencies** (plain JavaS"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"cript); the client source split\nis bundled ahead of release into the committed `lib/client.js`.\n- **"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"`design_studio` agent tool** — your assistant (and any subagent) can\n`list / all / create / read / w"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"rite / zip / reveal / delete / sweep` design systems,\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Node ≥ 22 and a harness on the **0.2.x** line (`engines.dsh`:\n`>=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0`; tested on `0."},{"id":"p12s2","text":"2.1-rc.2`) with the standard host services\n(`fs`, `subprocess`, `webServer`, `llm`, `credentials`, `"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"attachments`,\n`systemPrompt`, `tools`, plus optional `agents`/`subagents` for the design-agent chat)"},{"id":"p12s4","text":".\n- The workspace `design-studio/` folder is **created automatically** on first use;\nlegacy profile "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"designs remain readable. No symlink or manual setup is required.\n- For vision: a harness model that "},{"id":"p12s6","text":"advertises image input (preferred; no extra key),\nor an OpenRouter key under credential reference `O"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"PENROUTER_API_KEY` as the fallback.\n- For **📷 Capture**: a local Microsoft Edge, Google Chrome, or C"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"hromium install.\nIt is optional; the rest of the studio works without it.\n- For the optional **Andro"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"id Appium target**: Appium 3 with `uiautomator2` on\nloopback, an installed debug APK, and an authori"},{"id":"p12s10","text":"zed emulator/device. Explicit\nBuild & install invokes the configured build and install commands; see"},{"id":"p12s11","text":" the\nsecurity limitation.\n- The experimental **QaLens companion** is off by default and requires a\ns"},{"id":"p12s12","text":"eparately opted-in SDK/debug app and local workbench only if selected. Web,\nAppium, and Compose Desk"},{"id":"p12s13","text":"top users do not need QaLens or its Python tooling."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Design Studio is a **local, operator-trusted** tool."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- The HTTP API is loopback-only and unauthenticated. Do not expose the harness\nport to a network.\n- "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"The preview iframe is same-origin and deliberately unsandboxed so the element\npicker can inspect the"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" design DOM. A mockup’s HTML/JS is therefore executable\ncode with same-origin access; only open desi"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"gns you trust.\n- `asset_import` accepts local source paths. Treat the Studio API as equivalent\nto lo"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"cal file access.\n- Freeze is a tool/context guard, not an OS ACL. Direct file writes are outside\nits"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" control.\n- The workspace write fallback uses the Node write seam when the host fs policy\ndenies a d"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"esign path; it is restricted to the active design root."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## ⚠️ Compatibility notes — current harness contracts"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"This plugin was built and broken against a moving harness base. The traps that remain\nrelevant:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. **The design agent uses `startActivation`, not `start`.** The current contract is\n`ctx.subagents."},{"id":"p18s2","text":"startActivation({ provider, label, request, signal, delivery })`;\nthe request carries `prompt`, `par"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ent`, `cwd`, `signal` and `maxDepth`. The old\n`.start(provider, { persona, … })` call silently faile"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"d on 0.2.x.\n2. **A live session is a live Agent, and its id is `agent.id`.** The host-level\n`session"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"s` service no longer exists; orphan detection reads `ctx.agents.list()`.\nTool handlers must read `ex"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ec.agent.id`, not the removed `exec.agent.sessionId`.\n3. **Client modules must inject real client pa"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"ckages and load immediately.**\n`dsh.client.inject` now names `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversatio"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"n`,\n`…-ui-settings`, `…-ui-session` and `…-locale`; `immediately: true` makes the tab\nregister at bo"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"ot. The removed `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime` entry is gone.\n4. **`conversation.view` hands `ses"},{"id":"p18s10","text":"sionId` as a standard prop.** The obsolete\nregistration `inject: (sessionId) => ({ sessionId })` fac"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"e was removed; the view\nreads `props.sessionId` directly.\n5. **Send to the main chat through `Sessio"},{"id":"p18s12","text":"nFace.prompt`.** The scoped\n`conversation.send` path is gone; the tab uses\n`sessions.binding(id).ses"},{"id":"p18s13","text":"sion.prompt([{ type: 'text', text }], 'queue')`.\n6. **No shell assumptions.** The host builds shell "},{"id":"p18s14","text":"semantics itself only where it\nstill needs the subprocess seam (Node helper for binary writes/delete"},{"id":"p18s15","text":"s, OS file\nmanager for reveal). ZIP export is a built-in store-only writer. This is what makes\nthe p"},{"id":"p18s16","text":"lugin work on Windows.\n7. **Commit `lib/`.** A harness checkout's `.gitignore` ignores `lib/` — a pl"},{"id":"p18s17","text":"ugin\ncommitted inside one ships without its entry point. This repo lives at its own top\nlevel and sh"},{"id":"p18s18","text":"ips plain JS, so `lib/index.js` is committed.\n8. **Hard-inject host services you register against.**"},{"id":"p18s19","text":" `apply()` runs as soon as its\ninjections resolve; `webServer`, `systemPrompt`, `tools`, etc. must b"},{"id":"p18s20","text":"e in `inject`\nso the route/tool/section registration cannot be silently skipped.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
